  "prefLabel": "Pes 305.07 Manner of Application",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 305.07 Manner of Application. A private applicator in New Hampshire, when accepting a permit, shall agree to follow the instructions outlined on the manufacturer's label, including any restrictive use situations stated by the labeling, such as actual physical presence of a certified applicator when application is made by a non-certified applicator.\n\nSource. #8059, eff 5-30-04; ss by #10198-B, eff 10-3-12; ss by #13363, eff 6-1-22, EXPIRES: 6-1-32 (formerly Pes 305.09)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pes300.html"
